    "description": "Portfolio provenance block. concise (default): source, source_url, data_vintage, retrieved_at, retrieval, citation, license; detailed: the full canonical block (dataset, dimension_key, notices, served_from_cache, ...). retrieval is the origin diagnostic of this call \u2014 requests made to ILOSTAT, attempts including retries, anomalies overcome (timeout, network, rate_limited, http_5xx, http_4xx, malformed_body) and unstable (true when anything had to be retried: treat the figures as obtained with difficulty); null when nothing was fetched from ILOSTAT (catalogue or cached answer). Optional keys (field_sources, notices, derived, derivation_note, revision) appear only when there is something to say"
